# Generated corpus output (CORE-488). Rendered images, galleries and
# inspect pages are NOT committed (CORE-495): they are published to the
# typeanvil-showcase repo instead. Never force-add anything under
# corpus/out/. The one exception is corpus/out/compare/scoreboard.json,
# which stays tracked as the build-demo.sh --guard reference and is no
# longer refreshed by hand.
corpus/out/
corpus/out/compare.baseline/
corpus/out/showcase.baseline/

# benchmark scratch renders
benchmarks/.work/

# issue-evidence dumps from scripts/pickup.py (evidence lives in Linear)
probe/issue-evidence/

